#==============================================================================================
#
#   tests_skia_reference_data_3 - glyph masks as Skia's CPU text draws them
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Test vectors for tests_cpu_glyph_run.lucb: the premultiplied pixels (0xAARRGGBB per
#       pixel, rows top to bottom) that Ladybird's DisplayListPlayerSkia renders for glyph
#       runs (FreeType's masks at every quarter-pixel phase, on colored backgrounds, rotated
#       and scaled), and the eight mask pre-blend tables (SkTMaskGamma_build_correcting_lut
#       for contrast 128/255 and the sRGB device, one row of 256 bytes per luminance index,
#       as words), recorded locally from the reference build of Ladybird 47c82b38d0 (Skia
#       m144, FreeType 2.13.3).
#
#==============================================================================================

